                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane"} brane
            for a LG model is given by a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matrix+factorization"} matrix factorization
            of its superpotential.
