          %h2#references References
          %h3#in_superconductivity In superconductivity
          %p
            Discussion as a model for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superconductors"} superconductors
          %p The original article:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%D0%92.+%D0%9B.+%D0%93%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B7%D0%B1%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B3"}> В. Л. Гинзбург
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%D0%9B.+%D0%94.+%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%83"} Л. Д. Ландау
              = succeed "," do
                %em К теории сверхпроводимости
          %p English translation:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vitaly+Ginzburg"}> Vitaly Ginzburg
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lev+Landau"} Lev Landau
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Theory of Superconductivity
              %em On Superconductivity and Superfluidity
              Springer (2009) (
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-540-68008-6_4"}> doi:1007/978-3-540-68008-6_4
              )
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li#Chapman00
              %p
                S. J. Chapman, Section 2 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Hierarchy of Models for Type-II Superconductors
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/2653134"} jstor:2653134
            %li#Timm20
              %p
