                \-theoretic pullbacks for Lagrangians on derived critical loci
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.06025"}> arXiv:2503.06025
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h4#branes Branes
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/branes"} branes
            of the LG-model are discussed for instance in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anton+Kapustin"}> Anton Kapustin
